{
  "sequence_id": "seq_0dc2e3d874c804fc",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "This is our OOW thing we got here! It's gonna $7AY our own thing!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "When we do business with someone like Dino, it's on EVEN 7GR/15!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "HE CAN'T BE TRUSTED -- EXCEPT TO TRY AND PUT A COLLAR ON YOU, UNDER- STAND?!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "but if you WANT to roll over for him..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "...at least show me enough respect not to beg my fucking pardon."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Isn't that right, Arthur?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Hey, you're the boss."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I've got no complaints."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "THAT KEEPS THINGS NICE AND SIMPLE FOR ME."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "IF YOU REALLY MEAN IT..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "He knows."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Man, but like, I say Ash's Slippin'."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Couldn't even take those two fools out."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Fuck- head."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "What you think -- he kept MSS/MG?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "He called those shots like Billiards."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "IF HE WANTED 'EM DEAD, IT'VE BEEN ONE, TWO."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "But he took his time... Chunk out the cheek, little piece off the shoulder..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Krich"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "FROM TEN YARDS OFF, WITH A SHORTENED ..357..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "No. There ain't no way to beat him in a fair fight."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "MARYIN CALLED HIM A FUNK? DUDE DOESN'T KNOW SHIT ABOUT HIM  EITHER."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T11",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T12",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "i recall YOV not too wise one time on ash yourself."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T13",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Well, you might say his good looks clouded my judgment."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T14",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I got these fingers to remind me to give him that gentle touch of payback."
    }
  ],
